---
import PolicyLayout from "../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro";
---

<PolicyLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	eyebrow="Privacy Policy"
	updated="August 11, 2026"
	description="How Sky House Cleaning collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
	<p>
		Sky House Cleaning ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This policy explains what
		information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have, whether you're booking a
		service, browsing our website, or reaching out with a question.
	</p>

	<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
	<p>When you book a service or contact us, we collect the information you provide directly, such as:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Your name, email address, and phone number</li>
		<li>Your home or service address</li>
		<li>Vehicle details, if you're booking car detailing (year, make, model, color)</li>
		<li>Entry/access instructions, pet information, and any other notes you share about your appointment</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		We do not collect or store your full payment card details. Payment is handled directly by
		Stripe, our payment processor (see "Third-Party Services" below).
	</p>

	<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
	<p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Schedule, confirm, and perform the cleaning or detailing service you've booked</li>
		<li>Process payment for services</li>
		<li>Communicate with you about your appointment, including reminders and follow-ups</li>
		<li>Respond to questions or requests you send us</li>
	</ul>
	<p>We don't sell your personal information, and we don't use it for advertising.</p>

	<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
	<p>We rely on a few outside services to run our booking and payment process:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Stripe</strong>: processes payments securely. We don't see or store your full card number.</li>
		<li><strong>Google Calendar</strong>: used to schedule and manage appointment times.</li>
		<li><strong>Google Fonts</strong>: loads the typefaces used on this site directly from Google's servers.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Each of these services has its own privacy practices governing how they handle data, and we
		encourage you to review their policies if you'd like more detail.
	</p>

	<h2>Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
	<p>
		We don't currently use analytics or advertising cookies on this site. Our website host may
		log basic technical information (like IP address and browser type) as part of standard web
		hosting, which we don't use to identify or track individual visitors.
	</p>

	<h2>Data Retention</h2>
	<p>
		We keep your information for as long as needed to provide our services, maintain our
		business records, and meet any legal or tax obligations.
	</p>

	<h2>Security</h2>
	<p>
		We take reasonable steps to protect your information, but no method of storage or
		transmission over the internet is completely secure.
	</p>

	<h2>Your Rights</h2>
	<p>
		You can reach out any time to ask what information we have about you, request a
		correction, or ask us to delete it. California residents may have additional rights under
		state privacy law. To make a request, contact us using the information below.
	</p>

	<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
	<p>Our services and this website are not directed at children, and we don't knowingly collect information from anyone under 13.</p>

	<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
	<p>
		We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top will
		reflect the most recent changes.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact Us</h2>
	<p>
		Questions about this policy or your information? Reach us at
		{" "}<a href="mailto:info@skyhousecleaning.com">info@skyhousecleaning.com</a> or
		{" "}<a href="tel:+18017592044">(801) 759-2044</a>.
	</p>
</PolicyLayout>
